Acceptance criteria:
- Normal and error messages use readable translucent glass, not opaque green.
- The notice remains below the website logo and inside the viewport.
- The whole default handheld and power target remain clear of notice and dock
  at desktop, phone and short landscape sizes.
- Dismissal or moving a notice into tools restores the ordinary camera fit.
- Native gameplay, saves, input, fullscreen and cartridge behavior remain intact.

